flowchart TB
    A[make all] --> B{prog, up to date?}
    B -->|No| C[Check dependencies]
    B -->|Yes| D[Done]
    
    C --> E{main.o, newer than main.c?}
    E -->|No| F[gcc -c main.c]
    E -->|Yes| G[Skip compilation]
    
    F --> H{All .o files ready?}
    G --> H
    
    H -->|Yes| I[gcc -o prog *.o]
    H -->|No| J[Compile remaining .c files]
    
    J --> H
    I --> K[prog created/updated]
    
    style K fill:#c8e6c9
    style D fill:#fff9c4
